7.1 Race Condition vs Synchronized

| Feature          | Without Synchronization | With Synchronization |
| ---------------- | ----------------------- | -------------------- |
| Race Condition   | ✅ Yes                   | ❌ No                 |
| Data Consistency | ❌ No                    | ✅ Yes                |
| Mutual Exclusion | ❌ No                    | ✅ Yes                |
| Thread Safety    | ❌ No                    | ✅ Yes                |

7.2 synchronized vs volatile

| Feature                 | `synchronized`          | `volatile` |
| ----------------------- | ----------------------- | ---------- |
| Prevents Race Condition | ✅ Yes                   | ❌ No       |
| Mutual Exclusion        | ✅ Yes                   | ❌ No       |
| Visibility              | ✅ Yes                   | ✅ Yes      |
| Atomic `count++`        | ✅ (by exclusive access) | ❌ No       |
